      "name": "dsh-disk-manager",
      "title": {
        "en": "Disk Manager",
        "zh": "磁盘管理器"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Browse local disks from the right sidebar the way This PC and Disk Management do: volume overview with usage bars, folder browsing with sorting and grouping, drag files straight into the chat composer, on-demand folder sizes, desktop shortcuts with real app icons, three-level hover previews, multiple panes, and delete to Recycle Bin. Windows only; no partition operations.",
        "zh": "在右侧栏按「此电脑 / 磁盘管理」的逻辑浏览本地磁盘：卷总览带已用进度条、目录浏览支持排序与分组、把文件直接拖进对话输入框、按需统计目录大小、桌面快捷区显示程序真图标、三级悬停预览、可多开、删除只进回收站。仅支持 Windows，不做任何分区操作。"
      },
